.TH ALI-PERF 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-perf, ali-normal \- switch CPU governor at runtime
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-perf
.br
.B ali-normal
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ali-perf
pins every CPU to the
.B performance
governor right now.
.B ali-normal
restores the default (schedutil, else powersave).
Full effect (mitigations off) needs the Performance boot entry;
see the GRUB menu. No output on success beyond confirmation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-info (1)
